{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1000_p", "source_sha256": "99d3351992f3410cb7c6535e9b7d90f5dd10217c0e1992b99cec3b514836d977", "ja": "（今日は『ソル』のゲネプロの日。本番さながらの\n迫力に、圧倒された……凄いクオリティだ）", "zh": "（今天是『Sol』进行彩排的日子。仿佛正式演出一般的气势让我目瞪口呆……质量真高啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "0361479465b796b7d7d6f57cd648d4bb54af625db95ff5bec302f831eeb36ffc", "ja": "「これなら『ソル』の公演は満員間違いなし！\nこれで俺の給料もがっぽりだな！　わっはっは～っ！」", "zh": "“这样一来，『Sol』的演出绝对会场场爆满！\n我的薪水也能大赚一笔啦！哇哈哈哈哈～！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4f1328ad4b2d33c63991380a52342f9add9b490eeb430d9979c90b9525dc3aab", "ja": "勝手にアテレコするんじゃない。\nそれに満員になっても、給料は変わらないぞ。", "zh": "别擅自给人配音。\n而且就算场场坐满，工资也不会变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "4bd34760f856841d519ca5dfe44d278e302ab956d8154ef0b19069cd575c29f7", "ja": "ええっ、そーなの！？\nなんか……つまんないね、兄ちゃん。", "zh": "诶诶，是这样的吗！？\n总觉得……好没意思啊，哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1004_p", "source_sha256": "56cd09194c0a3e749bc14401d294ca13e58d047ac0c15c05fd92e41889b0ba54", "ja": "つまんなくない！　しかし、今日はたくさん\n動いたのに、まだエネルギーが余ってるみたいだな？", "zh": "才不无聊！不过，今天明明活动了这么多，看来精力还剩不少啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "8510d714cf21fa24e76a0d76ff13beddab943c463334eea2089f2ec10f69b261", "ja": "とーぜんだよ！　このくらいでバテてたら、\n『ソル』としてのシメジがつかないかんね！", "zh": "当然啦！要是这点程度就累趴下了，作为『Sol』，可就没法当好“蘑菇”了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5d9ceca5617718da0aab50af0d65c951431b9851fdccfc7010914d8602c5abd6", "ja": "……示し、のことか？　でも確かにそう言うだけある、\n完成度の高いパフォーマンスだったよ。", "zh": "……你是说“示范”吧？不过，确实是一场配得上这么说的高水准表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b099ce2f33ef077dde4addb7ada2b4f5426ca127f1bb8ccad397e332477eca1a", "ja": "なんだか、これまでとも少し違う、\n凄みを感じたような……何か心境の変化があったのか？", "zh": "总觉得和之前稍微有些不同，似乎感受到了一种非同寻常的气势……是心境发生了什么变化吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "afc257e0300672642f6e8f7b59ade7cbbb9fc5b5c451e5885dcfca5f058a708d", "ja": "ほほう、さすが違いのわかる業界人だね、兄ちゃん。\n亜美達のこと、むっちりカンサツしてますなー。", "zh": "哦哦，不愧是懂行的业内人士啊，哥哥。一直在胖乎乎地观察我们呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1009_p", "source_sha256": "56e997f7c561fac09fcfcd05625e6f8739b390eea21bfbcb2c07bde55212b613", "ja": "むっちりはしてないと思うけど……。\nまあ、みんなのことはずっと見てきたから。", "zh": "我觉得还没到丰腴的程度吧……不过，我一直都在关注大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "0f68d9d8a918311bb0fcf6e8a7f7a8a398afa3fd96c6f83a89943dac0d5405f5", "ja": "えへへ、そっかー。まあ、原因は多分アレだね。\n実は昨日、みんなでアレを見直したからだよね～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，是这样啊。嗯，原因大概就是那个吧。其实昨天大家一起重新看了那个演出嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "ae043b6abbeee9683def7528397342f9b32c3eab711d02db8aee2a17fcc90bc5", "ja": "『Sunshine Rhythm!』の公演！", "zh": "『Sunshine Rhythm!』的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1012_p", "source_sha256": "840fd1afb36ae25e1739f9d647cd5aa7a74705b9a0c7a30614fde9a308a74f3d", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか？", "zh": "这样啊，是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "4639dd2232f1da30fd20cf2848a64eac4f3d4dbacd469c7e78be4885ca3ef85c", "ja": "やっぱりすごかったよ～。キラキラでピカピカで、\nあとポカポカで、めっちゃ一緒に踊りたくなる感じ！", "zh": "果然很厉害呢～又闪闪发光又亮晶晶的，\n而且暖洋洋的，让人超级想一起跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "e9db34d24db23fcaf876172f1ca5b6e4eb25637db501e0b8f629480483d9de3a", "ja": "みなりんたちの、あのステージを照らすくらい！\n『ソル』はそういうステージにしなきゃねって！", "zh": "要像美奈玲她们那样，耀眼到能照亮整个舞台！\n“索尔”也得成为那样的舞台才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8261ad586375fe175e13330ec610877fc328765af9edd6ba0154fcd015904ad0", "ja": "なるほど、スイッチを入れ直したわけだな。", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说重新振作起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "9ce1093ce0b927428bd297792dd95e38499bc0f05af1993c689b4801fad20ca7", "ja": "うん！　みんなメッチャやる気でね、このあと\n兄ちゃんと演出の話もする予定なんだって♪", "zh": "嗯！大家都干劲十足的，说是接下来还打算和哥哥聊聊演出的事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1017_p", "source_sha256": "944d2e90f167872159fc54a65621ff278734abebfa81c6a78999b12f646add77", "ja": "なるほど、そこまで……え、この後？\n俺と？　ゲネプロ中に……！？", "zh": "原来如此，竟然到了这种程度……诶，之后？\n和我？　在彩排中……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0383_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "cdc5a254184188b46ba2b105f04dcffe49aff6b001fc89df1224747af297bf05", "ja": "フッ、火がついちまったのさ。『ソル』って言う名の\n太陽にね！　てことで、みんなー、こっちこっちー！", "zh": "哼，名为“索尔”的太阳……已经点燃了我的斗志！所以，大家——这边这边——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
